WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Welcome. This demo shows how to find a resource in a fictional library catalogue.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.800
Choose the search box and enter a title or subject. For example, enter climate.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.800
Read the result. Check the title, location and availability before choosing an item.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.800
Open the record for more information. Ask library staff if you need assistance.

